# Via Code

You can also add listeners via script using `button.onClick.AddListener()`:

```csharp
public Button myButton;

void Start()
{
    myButton.onClick.AddListener(DoSomething);
}

void DoSomething()
{
    Debug.Log("Button clicked!");
}
```

This is dynamic – you can add/remove listeners at runtime.

